[00:00.00] 作词 : Jimmy Robbins/Chris Tompkins/Rocky Block
[00:00.00][by:土豆头_先生]
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Jimmy Robbins/Chris Tompkins/Rocky Block
[00:10.62]When I'm sittin' here alone
[00:10.62]当我一个人坐在这儿  
[00:12.61]Gettin' drunk and gettin' stoned
[00:12.61]喝着酒 抽着烟  
[00:14.48]I'm thinkin' 'bout you
[00:14.48]满脑子都是你  
[00:18.43]Been a hard wall to climb
[00:18.43]这段日子太难熬  
[00:20.45]Swear to God I'm doing time
[00:20.45]发誓我像在服刑  
[00:22.42]Here without you
[00:22.42]没有你陪在身边  
[00:26.66]Sun's sinkin' low, here we go
[00:26.66]夕阳一点点落下，故事又开始了  
[00:29.33]Another shadow to fight through
[00:29.33]又要和心里的影子周旋  
[00:33.63]That's what I do
[00:33.63]这就是我擅长的  
[00:37.48]That whole damn night through
[00:37.48]整整一个夜晚  
[00:44.88]It's sinkin' in, what coulda been
[00:44.88]慢慢明白了 曾经可能发生的一切  
[00:47.10]I'm with her, you're with him and that ain't right
[00:47.10]我和她在一起 你和他在一起 说不上对劲  
[00:52.81]And the sunset is when it starts
[00:52.81]每当太阳下山 一切才刚开始  
[00:54.87]Sky ain't all that's gettin' dark till daylight
[00:54.87]天色暗下的不只是天空 还有我的心  
[00:58.65]I'm strung out, I'm a mess
[00:58.65]我神志恍惚 狼狈不堪  
[01:00.92]Words and whiskey on my breath
[01:00.92]嘴里都是没说完的话和酒精的味道  
[01:02.66]See how faded I can get by sunrise
[01:02.66]看看天亮之前 我还能堕落到什么样  
[01:08.60]Yeah, I'm fallin' apart
[01:08.60]是啊 我彻底崩溃了  
[01:10.62]Sky ain't all that's gettin' dark till daylight
[01:10.62]天色暗下的不只是夜晚 还有我的心  
[01:21.27]I'm sinkin' up, and comin' down
[01:21.27]时而清醒 时而沉沦  
[01:23.50]That's a slow way to drown
[01:23.50]慢慢下沉 像是在溺水  
[01:25.38]It's what I'm used to
[01:25.38]可我早就习惯了  
[01:29.45]A touch that cuts you deep
[01:29.45]那种触碰像刀子般锋利  
[01:31.21]It's hard to find, it's hard to keep
[01:31.21]难得拥有 难得守住  
[01:33.15]It's hard to lose too
[01:33.15]可失去的时候也一样残忍  
[01:37.00]Another smoke, another flame
[01:37.00]再来一根烟 再点一把火  
[01:39.14]Another rush to the brain, but it ain't you
[01:39.14]让快感冲上脑袋 但依旧不是你  
[01:44.64]That's what I do
[01:44.64]这就是我擅长的  
